{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cec.zju.edu.cn/2026/0807/c36131a3193858/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:13.462825+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.cec.zju.edu.cn/2026/0807/c36131a3193858/page.htm","html":"<div><p></p><p><span><span><span><span>浙江大学</span></span><span><span><span>经济学院</span></span></span><span><span>竭诚欢迎全国各高校优秀本科毕业生推荐免试来我</span></span><span><span><span>院</span></span></span><span><span>攻读研究生。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span>  一、</span></span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>报名时间与方式</span></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>外校同学申请报名时间为</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><span><span>10:00</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>至</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span><span>10</span></span></span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span><span><span>24:00</span></span></span></span><span><span>。报名方式等详见“浙江大学关于</span></span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年接收外校推荐免试研究生工作安排的通知”</span></span><span><span><span>，</span></span></span><span><span>网址：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/yjszs/2026/0805/c28479a3193539/page.htm</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong><span><span><span><span>二、</span></span></span></span></strong><strong><span><span><span>填报注意事项</span></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>（一）系统上传材料要求（下列文件放入一个文件夹并压缩为一个文件包上传）</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>身份证：原件扫描件，正反面置于同一页面，仅截图无效</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>个人照片：证件照或生活照均可</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span><span><span>本科期间成绩单及排名证明：均须加盖学校</span></span><span>/</span></span><span><span>学院相关部门公章，排名证明应注明名次和参加排名的总人数</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span><span>外语水平证明：大学英语六级成绩单等</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.</span></span><span><span><span>已发表的论文、获奖证书：扫描件，合计不超过</span></span><span>6</span></span><span><span>项。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）成绩单、排名学期要求</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>原则上成绩和排名应为前</span></span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span>个学期。如在申请截止日期前还没有出前</span></span><span>6</span></span><span><span><span>个学期的成绩及排名的，请提交前</span></span><span>5</span></span><span><span>学期的成绩和排名，并在系统【备注信息】处说明。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）申请本科直博要求</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span><span>外语要求：英语六级≥</span></span><span>500</span></span><span><span><span>分，成绩有效期为五年；或新托福≥</span></span><span>90</span></span><span><span><span>分，或雅思（学术类）≥</span></span><span>6.5</span></span><span><span>分，不认可家庭版和拼分成绩，参照证书的有效期。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span><span>须提供至少两名报考学科专业领域内副教授及以上职称专家（或相当专业职称的专家）的书面推荐意见。模板详见附件，</span></span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span>份推荐信于</span></span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月中下旬复试资格审查时现场提交，可提前准备完毕。</span></span></p><p><a href=\"http://www.cec.zju.edu.cn/2026/0807/c36131a3193858/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span><span><span><span>三、</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>报考方向说明</span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span>按专业招生拟录取，拟录取后再按所报方向、方向录取人数及成绩确定拟录取方向。可根据本人意向在报名系统选择【意向攻读方向】。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>金融专硕方向（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>01</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>数字金融、</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>02</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>资产管理、</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>03</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>投资银行）为经济学院招生方向。</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>04</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>金融科技（</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>iMF</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）方向为浙江大学国际联合商学院招生方向，由浙江大学国际联合商学院（海宁校区）全权负责，招生、教学与学生管理，培养方案、项目详情以及推免通知请参加</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>ZIBS</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>官网：</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><a href=\"https://link.wtturl.cn/?target=https://zibs.zju.edu.cn&amp;scene=im&amp;aid=582478&amp;lang=zh\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>zibs.zju.edu.cn</span></a></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>四、</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>咨询联系方式</span></span></span></span></strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>咨询邮箱：</span></span><span>sainanwang@zju.edu.cn</span></span><span><span>（推荐邮件咨询）</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>咨询电话：</span></span><span>0571-88981625</span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"assets/articles/media/4c3b492ca5c48cbaed83.gif\"/><a href=\"http://www.cec.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/e9/bf/935d741c4b45aa537d5eec394308/16bb329b-fd49-42fd-90e5-aa66fb1aa01b.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><a href=\"http://www.grs.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/58/00/9de036b24f33b07ec2832af5ae55/0202f027-f2f0-4b8b-9794-892e59ed0d32.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>浙江大学攻读博士学位研究生专家推荐信模板</span></a></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"e31a9b0091c7aa13332a871cb4930316c30a822b339694eb9951543fef21ed58","textLength":917,"sourceSha256":"1b70e150fc7e55a3076fb4d2959866e6ae3b79710396adfad19c7b7b5e4dd402","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-5470d09e5b0f063b63c0","title":"2026年浙江大学经济学院关于2027年外校推荐免试生网上申请的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:52:13.462825+00:00","mirroredImages":[{"sourceUrl":"http://www.cec.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_doc.gif","file":"assets/articles/media/4c3b492ca5c48cbaed83.gif"}]}
